# Build context of Dockerfile and services/Dockerfile: allow list. Everything else stays out of the context (e.g. .git,
# .env, the profiles, the tests), so that a file can only reach an image when it's listed here.
*
!certs/bit-proxy-ca.pem
!certs/nexus-ca.pem
!certs/swissgov-root.cer
!entrypoint.sh
!notifications/agent-notify
!hooks/agent-memory-sync
!hooks/agent-memory-guard
!broker/*.py
!broker/gh
!broker/secrets.example
!services/*/requirements.txt
